animation_notes: |
  ## Cinematic Simulation Prompt — 03b: Orchestrator Dispatch Flow

  **SCENE 1 — "The Awakening" (0:00–0:06)**
  Camera: Static center-frame. Environment: Absolute dark-blue vacuum (#0a0e27).
  A high-resolution CORTEX logo (cortex-docs/assets/images/cortex-logo-512.png) fades in,
  centered on a ray-traced glassmorphism floor. An 'electric-aura' animation ignites —
  concentric cyan (#00d4ff) and purple (#7b61ff) pulse-glows radiate outward, reflecting
  off the polished glass surface. Volumetric blue fog at floor level. Hold 4s.
  Logo shrinks to bottom-right watermark (15% opacity).

  **SCENE 2 — "FPV Drone Dive: Request Entry" (0:06–0:12)**
  Camera: FPV drone dives from above through volumetric fog, arriving at the top of a
  vertical glassmorphism pipeline. The MCP Request node renders as a glowing green
  (#00ff88) frosted glass orb at the apex. A bioluminescent request particle (cyan orb
  with neon light-trail) spawns and begins its descent. The Validation gate appears
  below — a Deep Cobalt (#1a1f3a) diamond with ray-traced reflections. Brief fork
  animation: "Yes" path illuminates green, "No" path flashes red and sends a ghost
  particle to the Error node (red frosted glass, 20px blur).

  **SCENE 3 — "Intelligence Tiers" (0:12–0:24)**
  The particle passes validation and enters Intent Classification — a purple (#7b61ff)
  neon-filament capsule. It briefly splits into classification category ghosts before
  converging. The UnifiedIntelligenceProvider materializes as three concentric
  glassmorphism rings — each ring a different intelligence tier:
  - Inner ring: "quick — <10ms" (thin cyan glow, fastest pulse)
  - Middle ring: "targeted — +company domains" (medium cyan glow)
  - Outer ring: "full — +ADO sprint + KG index" (thick cyan glow, slowest pulse)
  The particle enters the appropriate ring tier based on request complexity.
  "Lidar Blue" laser sweep scans across all three rings simultaneously.

  **SCENE 4 — "The Routing Decision" (0:24–0:36)**
  Camera: Continues downward. The Router diamond (amber/Deep Cobalt glassmorphism)
  receives the particle. Six frosted glass capsules fan out below — OnboardingOrch,
  TDDOrch, PlanningOrch, DebugOrch, SweepOrch, DomainOrch. Each has internal neon
  filaments matching its domain color. The particle follows ONE path — that capsule
  illuminates to full brightness with purple neon filaments; all others dim to 20%
  opacity with blurred refraction. The selected orchestrator executes (spinner
  animation inside frosted glass). Result feeds into the Learning capture node —
  which pulses purple (#7b61ff) as a URS confidence update animates as a floating
  score. The Response node glows green at the bottom — particle exits downward.

  **SCENE 5 — "Orbital Reveal" (0:36–0:46)**
  Camera: 360-degree orbital pan around the complete vertical dispatch pipeline.
  All nodes glow at full luminosity — the bioluminescent trail persists as a permanent
  neon path from MCP Request through Router to the selected orchestrator and out.
  Volumetric fog swirls at the base. Ray-traced reflections cascade across all glass
  surfaces. Camera completes orbit, pulls back. Architecture fades to 40%.
  Glassmorphism "Evidence Bundle" icon materializes center-frame — sealed document
  with cyan checkmark — fades to black.
